<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,434 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>Dealers said the central bank bought $0.41 million to close trading.</p>
<p>					 Oct 17		  Oct 16</p>
<p> Dollar rate			  5,434		   5,434</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	4.50		    12.06</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
